## 🔧 Copilot Commands

### In VS Code

| Command | Shortcut | Purpose |
|---------|----------|---------|
| Accept suggestion | `Tab` | Accept current suggestion |
| Next suggestion | `Alt+]` | Cycle to next suggestion |
| Previous suggestion | `Alt+[` | Cycle to previous suggestion |
| Trigger suggestions | `Alt+\` | Manually trigger Copilot |
| Copilot Chat | `Ctrl+Shift+I` | Open Copilot Chat |

