## 🔍 Troubleshooting

### Copilot Not Suggesting
1. Check extension is enabled
2. Verify file is recognized as Ansible (`.yml`, `.yaml`)
3. Ensure you're signed in to GitHub
4. Try restarting VS Code

### Poor Suggestions
1. Add more context with comments
2. Open related files for better context
3. Use Copilot Chat for complex requirements
4. Manually edit and Copilot will learn

### Wrong Patterns
1. Check `.github/copilot-instructions.md` is present
2. Reference AGENTS.md in your prompt
3. Provide examples of desired pattern

